{"colorIdentity":["R","W"],"colors":["R","W"],"keywords":["Saga"],"layout":"saga","manaCost":"{R}{W}","manaValue":2,"name":"Litany of the Dawn-Fire","subtypes":["Saga"],"supertypes":[],"text":"(As this Saga enters and after your draw step, add a lore counter.)\nI — Create two 1/1 red and white Human Soldier creature tokens with haste. Those tokens attack this turn if able.\nII — Creatures you control get +1/+0 and first strike until end of turn.\nIII — Until end of turn, whenever a creature you control deals combat damage to a player, exile the top card of your library. You may play that card this turn.\n\"Set your doubts alight, and march.\" —Cantor of the Dawn-Fire","types":["Enchantment"]}

